cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "ETIS Engineering Platform Starter Kit"

message: "If you use the ETIS Engineering Platform or materials from this repository, please cite them using the metadata in this file."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "O'Connell"
    given-names: "William T."

abstract: >-
  The source repository for the ETIS Engineering Platform, the professional
  reference and implementation environment for applying the Engineering
  Trustworthy Intelligent Systems (ETIS) framework. The Platform provides
  Engineering Stages ES-100 through ES-114, reusable engineering templates,
  completed reference examples, governance assets, Project Workspace patterns,
  and repository-centered, evidence-centered engineering guidance for building
  trustworthy intelligent systems.

keywords:
  - "trustworthy intelligent systems"
  - "software engineering"
  - "engineering judgment"
  - "AI governance"
  - "AI-assisted engineering"
  - "evidence-centered engineering"
  - "repository-centered engineering"
  - "engineering lifecycle"
  - "systems engineering"

license: MIT

repository-code: "https://github.com/etis-framework/etis-starter-kit"

url: "https://platform.etisframework.org"
